# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NexStep — Root Environment Pointer
#
# All secrets and server configuration live in backend/.env
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env and configure there.
#
# Frontend public config (optional): frontend/.env
# Mobile public config (optional): mobile/.env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# See backend/.env.example for the full list of variables:
#   PORT, APP_URL, PG_*, JWT_SECRET, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET,
#   GEMINI_API_KEY, SMTP_*, payment keys
